Amber Heard speaks out after a leaked  video surfaces of her and Johnny Depp  having an alleged heated discussion the  video obtained by TMZ shows the 53 year  old actor throwing a wine bottle in a  kitchen with no further context for the  outbursts in a statement released to ET  amber explains quote I am NOT  responsible for the release of the video  it was not what I wanted and I am doing  what I can to force the media to take it  off the internet I underestimated the  toll that this difficult few months have  taken on me emotionally and physically  and the efforts made by the media to  intimidate and discredit me it is for  that reason and my desire to make the  healthiest choice for myself and  hopefully for Johnny that I am  attempting to resolve this matter in the  most private way possible et has reached  out to Depp's camp for comment on  Saturday the 30 year old actress arrived  to her long-awaited deposition in LA  with depth lawyers and eyewitness ldt  Hurd who wore dark sunglasses remained  silent as she walked through the front  door of the law office with her  attorneys Saturday morning the former  couple is expected to appear at an  upcoming hearing on August 17th
 

